    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical journey through the Tower of the Ancients, where young mages are summoned to uncover the secrets buried deep within its forgotten halls. In *Mage Outbreak*, players must solve puzzles, face mystical creatures, and connect fragments of a lost history to discover the truth about their ancestry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage Outbreak</strong> is a 2D pixel art adventure with action and puzzle elements, featuring short sessions and replayable stages. Whether playing solo or with friends, you\u2019ll explore handcrafted environments, dodge traps, cast spells, and unveil lore scattered throughout the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Pixel art action-adventure</strong> with mystical themes and atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udd0d <strong>Puzzle-solving</strong> mechanics combined with real-time movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf0c <strong>Procedural events and handcrafted rooms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Unlock secrets</strong> and piece together a mysterious storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Minimal UI</strong> and immersive ambient soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for players who enjoy short, magical adventures filled with lore, challenges, and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical journey through the Tower of the Ancients, where young mages are summoned to uncover the secrets buried deep within its forgotten halls. In *Mage Outbreak*, players must solve puzzles, face mystical creatures, and connect fragments of a lost history to discover the truth about their ancestry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage Outbreak</strong> is a 2D pixel art adventure with action and puzzle elements, featuring short sessions and replayable stages. Whether playing solo or with friends, you\u2019ll explore handcrafted environments, dodge traps, cast spells, and unveil lore scattered throughout the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Pixel art action-adventure</strong> with mystical themes and atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udd0d <strong>Puzzle-solving</strong> mechanics combined with real-time movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf0c <strong>Procedural events and handcrafted rooms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Unlock secrets</strong> and piece together a mysterious storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Minimal UI</strong> and immersive ambient soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for players who enjoy short, magical adventures filled with lore, challenges, and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
